# This repo stores sha256 hashes of every tracked input file and verifies them in
# CI. Any line-ending translation would change those hashes per platform and break
# every check, so text normalization is disabled outright. Do NOT add `text=auto`.
* -text

# Weather files are text but must stay byte-identical across platforms.
*.epw -text
*.ddy -text
*.stat -text

# Binaries.
*.db binary
*.zip binary
*.parquet binary
*.pq binary
*.xlsx binary

# No git-lfs filters anywhere. Inputs are small enough for plain git (the largest
# tracked file is ~4.5 MB) and LFS would break the "download it from GitHub with no
# setup" requirement. Large GIS files live in globi-partners-data instead; see
# docs/SCHEMA.md, `external_files`.
